# Metrics Creation

This file explains how to properly create metrics.
However, based on context, creator can make his own decisions.

---

## Guide

- The metrics should be added only inside metrics/ directory
- No metric should be inside xlade/ 
- Every metric should be inside a subdirectory, which tells its use
- One subdirectory can have more than one metric
- If a metric includes a script, then that script should be inside the scripts/ directory

